{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10294010","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10294010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1029401001:1":{"text":"크흠, 증인 성기사 테미히아, 페이 탐정이 당신에게 질문을 몇 가지 하겠습니다.","source_cn":"咳咳，证人圣骑士特弥希娅，菲侦探今天要对你进行质询。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2464CD9D9E38886","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029401002:1":{"text":"그래, 뭐가 궁금하지?","source_cn":"那么，你们想知道什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x863DC6D7142C53B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1029401002":{"text":"그래, 뭐가 궁금하지?","source_cn":"那么，你们想知道什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x863DC6D7142C53B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029401003:1":{"text":"약속한 대로, 그 후에 일어난 일들을 거짓 없이 알려 드리죠.","source_cn":"我会依照之前的承诺，将之后发生的事情如实告知各位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4D07C057901D5DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029401004:2":{"text":"테미히아, 말하기 싫으면 무리하지 않아도 돼...","source_cn":"特弥希娅，如果你不想说的话，不需要勉强自己……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB3C3BE67C177E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docu